Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||11-02-1999||11:47 PM||||my fiero was hit a while back, and i was wondering if anyone had any recommendations as far as what to do with the 450 bucks. like.. what mods could i get done/do myself that would help my fiero... also, lemme know approximate parts and relative difficulty. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||TOM||11-03-1999||10:42 AM||||What was the damage?||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroSTETZ||11-04-1999||12:34 PM||||paint scratches to my 3 month old paint, the license plate lights are smashed and the shift cables need to be adjusted... also idles at like 1200||||reg||1
Z||000003||WKDFIRO||11-05-1999||09:31 PM||||Wait, the shift cables need to be adjusted??? How hard were you hit? If they need to be adjusted check for damage to the cradle! Ive been in 3 accidents with my Fiero (The third from behind by a full sized Ford Pick up at 40 mph vs me at a stand still.) As for the idle you may have knocked loose a vacuum hose. Good luck in finding those!||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroSTETZ||11-08-1999||09:06 AM||||I think i was misunderstood... i got all the damage fixed (i did it) and now i have 450 dollars left over, and i want to know of performance modifications people recommend that i can get with 450 dollars or less..||||reg||1
Z||000005||Phil||11-08-1999||11:51 AM||||$450 is exactly what a set of leather seat covers from Pisa costs (inc. shipping)||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cliff D.||11-08-1999||07:56 PM||||If it is a V6, you can get a set of Tomco injectors from the Fiero Store for $399.95.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Terrybogin||11-08-1999||09:23 PM||||What good will $400 worth of injectors do? I picked up a set of very low mileage 5.7 liter injectors at the junkyard for $50, but they are probably too much for the stock 2.8. An under drive pulley set, free flowing exhaust, ported manifolds, MSD or similiar ignition, high performance coil, good wires, a nitrous kit. . . I  could think of a lot of ways to spend money!The only problem that I have is knowing when to stop spending.||||reg||5
Z||000008||Standard||11-09-1999||01:36 AM||||You should get your injectors blueprinted.  <BR> <A HREF="http://members.xoom.com/_XOOM/fierov6/OSG/fuel-injectors.html" TARGET=_blank>http://members.xoom.com/_XOOM/fierov6/OSG/fuel-injectors.html</A> <P>Look there for info about it.  Looks like a damn good deal, much cheaper than a new set of injectors.||||reg||1
Z||000009||DJRice||11-09-1999||09:01 AM||||Thats pretty close to a set of Fiero Headers......  But if you cant find anything you want to put on your car, just send me the money, as I have a couple of things I need to do to mine.<P>What about a new indash CD player, or some nice speakers all the way around?||||reg||1
